All three clear the benchmark admission gates (|IC| ≥ 0.0070, |ICIR| ≥ 0.0840) with robustness across regime splits (2020/2022/2023/2025 all show positive ICIR for admitted factors, except mom_curve_volscale in 2020 which is offset by strong 2022-2025 performance). Decay analysis confirms 10d-horizon peak predictive power.

