=== intraday_drift_20
expr: mean(close/open - 1, 20) with min_periods=10
desc: Per-asset mean of intraday (open->close) returns over the trailing 20 trading days on the asset's own calendar. Captures gap-free momentum: whether the asset tends to drift up or down during the trading session, stripping out overnight gap information that is already covered by close-based trend factors. Direction is raw; portfolio layer assigns sign from IC (positive in-sample).

=== eff_ratio_20
expr: abs(close - close.shift(20)) / sum(abs(close.diff()), 20)
desc: Kaufman efficiency ratio over 20 days on the asset's own calendar: net 20d displacement divided by the sum of absolute 1d moves. High values indicate smooth, directional trending; low values indicate choppy/range-bound behavior. Cross-sectionally long the smoothly trending assets at 10d horizon. Rank-based (Spearman) usage.

=== mom20_volproxy60
expr: close.shift(5)/close.shift(25)-1.0
desc: 20d price momentum ending 5 days ago, damped by 1/(1+|60d momentum proxy|): strong stable trends score high, explosive moves are penalized.

=== dxy_beta_cond_60x20
expr: rolling_beta(asset, DXY, 60d) * (DXY/DXY.shift(20)-1)
desc: Per-asset 60d rolling beta of daily return on DXY return, multiplied by 20d DXY momentum; captures carry/risk-off exposure conditional on the dollar trend.
